      "content": "\"breaking the rules\" is just another way of saying giving up. but when the rules are this heavy and the weight is constant, maybe giving up isn't even a rebellion... maybe it's just the only rational way to find actual peace. if there's nothing to lose because nothing actually matters, then why is it considered so wrong to just exit the loop? it seems like the only way to truly stop the noise.",
